Change: `use bytes::BufMut` becomes `use crate::io::BufMut` (the crate-local model from patch 01) in binlog/events/{mod,rows_event,user_var_event,xid_event}.rs.
Why: The same as patches 01 and 31.
Behaviour: Identical, as for patch 31: every `BufMut` call in these files (`put_slice`, `put_u8`, `put_u16_le`, `put_u64_le`) is on a `Vec<u8>`.

